{
  "title": "Oozy Turkish Kidney Bean Dolma",
  "description": "A peppery, gooey, nostalgic Turkish dish featuring kidney beans, air-fried to perfection in a claypot, lacto-vegetarian-friendly and served in a dolma form.",
  "cuisine": "Turkish",
